Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: boundary-extract
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: extract OSM administrative boundaries into a directory tree
 Reads an OpenStreetMap .pbf file and writes administrative boundaries as
 poly, GeoJSON polygon and GeoJSON linestring files. Directories mirror the
 geometric containment hierarchy. Supports buffering and simplification.
